    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Music Shop Simulator</strong>, your dusty little haven where the air smells like old vinyl, rosin, and questionable life choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell everything from vintage guitars to theremins, customize your shop, and keep the weirdest regulars coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day it\u2019s a kid buying their first tambourine. The next, a blues legend swears his harmonica is cursed. And that guy playing &quot;Stairway&quot; for the 47th time? He\u2019s family.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717530/extras/deb5311151af548e2d94c0c59cd2e712.avif?t=1755109702\" width=618 height=100 /></span><strong>Your to-do list:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy and sell:</strong> Stock the weird and the wonderful. Ukuleles, accordions, saxophones\u2026 whatever makes noise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the chaos:</strong> Manage inventory, balance budgets, and expand your space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attract the oddballs:</strong> Build a reputation that draws in musicians, collectors, and total beginners.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep the music alive:</strong> Host jam nights, themed events, and surprise performances.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717530/extras/deb5311151af548e2d94c0c59cd2e712.avif?t=1755109702\" width=618 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell all kinds of instruments and musical gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a parade of eccentric customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize, expand &amp; decorate your shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host wild events that make the neighbors complain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock \u201cwhy does this exist?\u201d upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create in-store playlists from a library of indie music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And\u2026 yeah, that\u2019s Elvis. Don\u2019t freak out</p></li></ul>",
